                     " (contain) "ReadSeeker is the interface that groups the basic Read and Seek methods."
           " (contain) ReadWriteCloser
                " (contain) kind
                     " (contain) interface
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "ReadWriteCloser is the interface that groups the basic Read, Write and Close methods."
           " (contain) ReadWriteSeeker
                " (contain) kind
                     " (contain) interface
                " (contain) description
                     " (contain) "ReadWriteSeeker is the interface that groups the basic Read, Write and Seek methods."
           " (contain) ReadWriter
